A||||29||Jake||Cops and Fieros||||13||
Z||000000||Jake||01-04-2001||04:14 AM||||Is it just me or don't Cops like little 2 seater sports cars? around here and they try to get them for everything but u can drive an old muscle car and they don't bother you as much. Never got in any trouble with a muscle car but as soon I did anything "wrong" in my Fiero I got hammered and they treat ya like you're a murderer cause it's such a small town with no crime and they are so bored all the time I guess. The first time I got pulled over in my fiero I was doin 55 in a 35. I didn't have my seatbelt on and my sunroof was out with both windows down and the stero cranked. The cop comes walkin up to my car unbuckling his gun. At the time my fiero said "wrap your ass in fiberglass" on the back window and the first thing out of the cops mouth was "Trying to wrap your ass around a tree ******* ?" I was just thinking to myself "here we go" The cop walked up to my car and I kinda smirked cause I had to look out of my sunroof to see his face cause the car was so low  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> anywho...I handed him my license and he goes "ya know how fast you were goin there Jake?" I said "Yup! Sure do" and he says "how fast?" I said "About 55" and he immediatley says "Right on the button" then he asks if I know what the speed limit is. I said "Ofcourse, I drive on this road everyday, plus you pulled me over right in front of this speed limit sign...it's 35" He gave me a dirty look and proceeded to ask "were you wearing your seatbelt?" I replied with "nope, don't believe in them for personal reasons" and he goes "I admire your honesty, I don't get many like you" I turned the other way and he goes "So how much pot have ya been smokin today?" I was like "what the hell are you talking about? I don't do that stuff." and he goes "I see ya got a cell phone there" I go "yeah" and he said "where did you steal it?" I said "I kept giving cellular-one money untill they agreed to give it to me without a strugle" and then he goes "how many beers did ya have so far today?" I go "none" and he goes "Okay, I'll be back" So I sit there and wait for a few minutes when he comes walkin back with my ticket. "well Jake, I'm gonna cut you a break since you were honest and give you 3 points instead of 4" I was like "Okie Dokie" and he goes "On one condition" I say "what's that?" and he goes "Let us search your car" At this point I was gettin a little mad for the way I was being treated just for going over the speedlimit on a straight country road without another car in sight. But I say "okay sure" so they start tearing her apart and the one cop starts putting his face in my seat. while the other one starts examining leaves that had fallen from the tree above the car into the sunroof. The one who was sniffing my seat says "You don't smoke pot huh?" I was like "Don't even try it, I just bought this car last week. I'll take a wiz quiz right now!" and he goes "I can smell it in the seats plain as day" I said "Oh really?" and he goes "Yup, that's right" I said "Well I know exactly what weed smells like because I know alot of people that do it and I know that my seats don't smell like it, do you wanna know why?" and the cop goes "sure, why don't you tell me?" and I said "cause I just put those seat-covers in 2 hours ago!" (which I really did) and I showed him the reciept. He gave me a really dirty look and they put my car back together and gave me my ticket and let me go finally. And then...a few weeks go by, I'm helping a friend fix his exaust leak on his fiero when it starts pouring down raining. I look over at my car and remember I don't have my sunroof in and it's layin at my house. So my friend throws a tarp over it while i finish up. I hang out for a little bit and the rain slows way down. I told him I'm gonna head back to my house while It wasn't pouring and I scoot on outa there. Well I get to a road called "race-track road" when it starts pouring again. So as a natural reaction, I go a little faster. Ofcourse I'm getting pulled over again for going 40 in a 30. Cops walks up, it's the same one. He says, "why ya goin so fast this time?" I say, "well I don't have my sunroof in and I'm not going all that fast. I'm just tryin to get back to my house" and he says "Yeah, whatever" and takes my license back to his car and comes back with another ticket ofcourse. Then he starts giving me a lecture on how I should be worring about geting home safe instead of not being wet and I go "well sir, I wasn't worried about getting wet...I'm worried about my $700 stereo system" and he goes "well I wouldn't have pulled you over if you didn't mash on it back there when you saw me" I was like "Huh?! If I saw you, why would I hammer it? that would be dumb...and this is a 4cyl automatic." I told him I had a bad sensor which I really did and you had to give it a little more gas than usual or it would just sputter. He just shrugged his shoulders and gave me my ticket. Now this really ticks me off. I got totally sideways all over the place on a big highway right in front of a cop once in my old 5.0 mustang. It had a huge cowl hood, pretty much straight pipes...I mean, this thing was "the violation" cops are lookin for and he lets me off with a warning and have a nice day sir. I can drive around in my 78 pontiac with glasspacks and no tailpipes while cops are sitting somewhere on partrol speeding...they don't give me a second look. I go by one in my fiero or Rx-7 doing the speedlimit just passing a cop on a road when we are going the opposite ways of eachother. They turn around and follow me to make me nervous and do somethin wrong. Or I'll just stop somewhere and they'll walk up to me and ask me stupid questions about drugs or something when I walk out to my car. I'm gettin really sick of crap like this. sorry this was so long, but it gets me torqued  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||13
